Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.78,0:00:11.43,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf18}und {\kf24}liest {\kf14}aus {\kf20}den {\kf72}Echos, {\kf8}wo {\kf10}die\N{\kf16}Mücke {\kf58}fliegt {\kf38}und {\kf20}wohin {\kf20}sie {\kf48}ausweicht.
