Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:59.03,Naechste,,0,0,0,,Blitz und elektrische Entladung, Gen und DNA.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf26}Blitz {\kf16}und {\kf52}elektrische\N{\kf81}Entladung, {\kf27}Gen {\kf33}und {\kf55}DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.93,Naechste,,0,0,0,,Übergangen werde, was das Leib-Seele-Problem
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.63,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k39}{\kf53}Übergangen {\kf62}werde, {\kf10}was\N{\kf17}das {\kf89}Leib-Seele-Problem
