Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.35,0:04:01.77,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf8}die {\kf16}sich {\kf18}wie {\kf28}Menschen\N{\kf88}verhalten, {\kf10}aber {\kf20}nichts {\kf53}erleben.
