Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.43,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf10}mich {\kf14}wie {\kf18}eine {\kf50}Fledermaus {\kf14}zu {\kf60}verhalten.
