Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.85,0:05:34.60,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\kf10}wie {\kf20}es {\kf46}ist, {\kf10}ein {\kf24}Mensch {\kf24}zu {\kf41}sein.
